&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;modalcontainer&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;modalbox&quot;&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span&gt;Info&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;credit first&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;iframe src=&quot;http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--code/info%3Astyle/3&quot; align=&quot;&quot; frameborder=&quot;&quot; height=&quot;&quot; scrolling=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;&quot; class=&quot;close-credits&quot; style=&quot;height:2em;margin: 0;padding: 0;border: 0;background: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/ellie3-gimmick-free&quot;&gt;More by this author&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;credit-back&quot; style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;iframe src=&quot;http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--code/info%3Astyle/2&quot; align=&quot;&quot; frameborder=&quot;&quot; height=&quot;&quot; scrolling=&quot;no&quot; width=&quot;&quot; class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;height:2em;width: 100%;margin: 0;padding: 0;border: 0;background: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;creditBottomRate&quot; style=&quot;position:relative;height:30px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center; top: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;scp-image-block block-right&quot; style=&quot;width:300px;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/scp-6666-j/doughnut.jpg&quot; style=&quot;width:300px;&quot; alt=&quot;doughnut.jpg&quot; class=&quot;image&quot; /&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;scp-image-caption&quot; style=&quot;width:300px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Image taken from Junior Researcher Pene Ladro&#039;s social media that is presumed to have contained SCP-6666-J&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Item #:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-6666-J&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Object Class:&lt;/strong&gt; Euclid&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Special Containment Procedures:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-6666-J is contained in a standard humanoid containment cell. In order to combat its anomalous capabilities, it is fed a diet consisting of holy water and fruit grown with exclusively holy water&lt;sup class=&quot;footnoteref&quot;&gt;&lt;a id=&quot;footnoteref-556036-1&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot; class=&quot;footnoteref&quot;  &gt;1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;During mealtimes, SCP-6666-J must be closely monitored to ensure it does not bite a fruit in a way that produces a phallic shape.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Description:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-6666-J is a demon currently possessing the body of Junior Researcher Pene Ladro. When SCP-6666-J is exposed to non-holy food, it is capable of taking the form of a more phallic-shaped version of said food which, when consumed by a victim&lt;sup class=&quot;footnoteref&quot;&gt;&lt;a id=&quot;footnoteref-556036-2&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot; class=&quot;footnoteref&quot;  &gt;2&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;, allows SCP-6666-J to possess the consumer&#039;s body.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;When inside of an SCP-6666-J-1 instance, SCP-6666-J is able to manifest different powers, such as teleportation, telepathy, flight, and most notably the ability to leave the body of SCP-6666-J-1, through the means of consuming phallic-shaped foods.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Past SCP-6666-J-1 instances, which have been found to be primarily male-identifying, do not have any memory of their possession aside from a deep voice exclaiming the words &amp;quot;it&#039;s snatchin&#039; time!&amp;quot; at which they recognize they no longer have a phallus.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Addendum:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;report-box&quot;&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span&gt;INCIDENT SCP-6666-J-1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Incident SCP-6666-J-1 occurred when Dr. Noah Addams attempted to interview SCP-6666-J. The interview has been transcripted below.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;quote-block&quot;&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;lt;Begin Log&amp;gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dr. Noah Addams:&lt;/strong&gt; Hello, SCP-6666-J.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;The audio of the log appears to cut out for a few seconds.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dr. Addams:&lt;/strong&gt; Ow!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;lt;End Log&amp;gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
Following the incident, no further interviews with SCP-6666-J are to be conducted.&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnotes-footer&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Footnotes&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-556036-1&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;1&lt;/a&gt;. Excluding bananas&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-556036-2&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;2&lt;/a&gt;. Hereby referred to as SCP-6666-J-1&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

