				<title>SCP-5232</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5232</link>
				<description>

&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: right;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;scp-image-block block-right&quot; style=&quot;width:300px;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/scp-5232/SCP-5232&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--resized-images/scp-5232/SCP-5232/medium.jpg&quot; style=&quot;width:300px;&quot; alt=&quot;SCP-5232&quot; class=&quot;image&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;scp-image-caption&quot; style=&quot;width:300px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SCP-5232 during testing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Item #:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-5232&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Object Class:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: line-through;&quot;&gt;Safe&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: line-through;&quot;&gt;Keter-Pending&lt;/span&gt; Keter&lt;strong&gt;(See Experiment transcript 3 for more details.)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Special Containment Procedures:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-5232 is to be contained inside a 3m&lt;sup&gt;2&lt;/sup&gt; containment chamber, inside of a case comprised mainly of Glass, Pyrex, and [DATA EXPUNGED]. An exclusion zone of 3m&lt;sup&gt;2&lt;/sup&gt; is to be maintained at all times, outside of testing. The only personnel allowed inside the exclusion zone are Class-D personnel. Any other personnel to be placed inside are to be first cleared by 2 Overseer-Class Personnel. All testing is to be overseen by One (1) Level-3 Personnel or higher. Any Level-1 and -2 Personnel who access information divulging the existence of SCP-5232 are to be administered Class-B amnestics by using a textual Infohazard.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Protocol 202-5232-A forbids any foundation personnel to enter the cell other then Class-D personnel, and even then inside the perimeters of testing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;It has also been concluded that SCP-5232 is indestructible, and shall be treated accordingly.&lt;strong&gt;(See addendum SCP-5232-1 for more details.)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Description:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-5232 is a six-sided silver dice of &lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: line-through;&quot;&gt;unknown origin&lt;/span&gt; &lt;strong&gt;(See addendum SCP-5232-1 for more details)&lt;/strong&gt;.SCP-5232 does not manifest any anomalous properties until an entity (humans, animals,or plants) comes within 3m&lt;sup&gt;2&lt;/sup&gt; of SCP-5232. If an entity comes within the aforementioned area, the dice will proceed to roll itself through unknown means, which tests have shown is completely randomized. &lt;strong&gt;(See SCP-5232 testing log for more details.)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Once this has happened, an event (known as SCP-5232-1 through -6) will manifest &lt;strong&gt;(see SCP-5232 testing logs for more details.)&lt;/strong&gt;. it is unknown how the dice achieves these events.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;table class=&quot;wiki-content-table&quot;&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;th&gt;Testing agent&lt;/th&gt;
