&lt;div class=&quot;blockquote&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CLASS-D:&lt;/strong&gt; [D-4546]&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Test Overseer (TO):&lt;/strong&gt; Nadiva Raghe&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Foreword:&lt;/strong&gt; Testing if using a metallic clamp to stop the dice from rolling, and therefore manifesting its anomalous abilities, will prove successful&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;lt;Begin Log, [11:53]&amp;gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;TO:&lt;/strong&gt; [D-4546, please enter the cell. After this is completed, proceed to clamp the dice with the equipment you were given.]&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Class-D Appears apprehensive.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CLASS-D:&lt;/strong&gt; OK&amp;#8230;what should I observe for exactly?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;TO:&lt;/strong&gt; Anything out of the ordinary.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;TO:&lt;/strong&gt; And, remember, all questions will not be answered. this is your only warning.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Class-D clamps the tongs onto the dice.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;TO:&lt;/strong&gt; Interesting. The dice appears to be melting the clamps and continuing to roll itself in midair.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CLASS-D:&lt;/strong&gt; I&amp;#8230;Is that bad? It looks like it&#039;s stopped.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;TO:&lt;/strong&gt; D-4546, I cannot see the number on the top of the dice. What does it show?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CLASS-D:&lt;/strong&gt; It shows a six, why?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;TO is silent for a couple seconds.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;TO:&lt;/strong&gt; OK. I have an idea. D-4546, please proceed to leave the room. You have finished the test.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Class-D appears relieved.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CLASS-D:&lt;/strong&gt; Oh&amp;#8230;thank you. I wonde-&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Class-D Screams. Cause of death is determined as a mass production of acid by the body, ending in death.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;TO:&lt;/strong&gt; OK, it appears that even by leaving the area, death can and will still occur.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;TO2:&lt;/strong&gt; TO, This is TO2. how did the test go and what did we find out?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;TO:&lt;/strong&gt;Nothing especially interesting.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;TO2:&lt;/strong&gt; Alright.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;TO and TO2 are silent.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;TO2:&lt;/strong&gt; Very well, Shall we start again?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;TO sighs.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;TO:&lt;/strong&gt; you know what, maybe not. I need a coffee.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;lt;End Log, [12:07]&amp;gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Closing Statement:&lt;/strong&gt; N/A&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;blockquote&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CLASS-D:&lt;/strong&gt; [D-35233]&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Test Overseer (TO):&lt;/strong&gt; Dr Nadiva Raghe&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Foreword:&lt;/strong&gt; Testing&#039;s purpose is to see if a physical barrier that blocks the line of sight between the entity and SCP-5232 will stop the anomalous effects.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;lt;Begin Log, [12:15]&amp;gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;TO:&lt;/strong&gt; D-35233, please proceed into the cell. Also, make sure to keep that riot shield in front of you at all times. your life may depend on it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CLASS-D:&lt;/strong&gt; Yes, ma&#039;am&amp;#8230; what are we doi-&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;TO:&lt;/strong&gt; That&#039;s not for you to know, now enter the cell as instructed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CLASS-D:&lt;/strong&gt; Am I supposed to be looking for something? Or some changes in the room?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;TO:&lt;/strong&gt; Now, do you see the dice.?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CLASS-D:&lt;/strong&gt; Yep.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;TO:&lt;/strong&gt; Please position the Riot Shield so you cannot see the device, yet the camera mounted on it can.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Camera shifts, and SCP-5232 appears.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CLASS-D:&lt;/strong&gt; As you wish.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CLASS-D:&lt;/strong&gt; It appears to be rolling itself, is this normal behavior?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;TO:&lt;/strong&gt; Yes, now no more questions!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CLASS-D:&lt;/strong&gt; Okay&amp;#8230;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;SCP-5232 is shown to display a 5 side up. D-35233 cannot see this.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;TO:&lt;/strong&gt; Does anything appear to be happening around you?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CLASS-D:&lt;/strong&gt; No, but I am starting to feel a little strange.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Researcher:&lt;/strong&gt; I&#039;ll get security to escort you to a medical room where we can issue a full-body sc-&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CLASS-D:&lt;/strong&gt; AHHHh! Whats happened to me?!?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;D-35233 is shown on the ground, maggots pouring out of mouth and eyes.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Sounds of reaching can be heard, and the microphone cuts.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;lt;End Log, [12:21]&amp;gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Closing Statement:&lt;/strong&gt; [Test was unsuccessful. However, we now think that the higher the roll of the dice, the more dangerous effects take place on the subject. However, more tests are required to prove that theory. It must also be noted that the security guard who tranquilized D-35233 had previously come in contact with SCP-5232 and had survived with only a broken leg as a casualty, after rolling a 2.]&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;blockquote&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CLASS-D group:&lt;/strong&gt; [D-54224, D-93722, D-54642, D-74544 and D-44463]&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Test Overseer (TO):&lt;/strong&gt; Dr Simon Allen (TO Nadiva Raghe was excused, after suffering an emotional breakdown.)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Foreword:&lt;/strong&gt; Testing if having multiple subjects in the cell will affect how the anomaly works&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;lt;Begin Log, [12:32]&amp;gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;TO:&lt;/strong&gt; CLASS-D personnel, please enter the cell together at roughly the same time&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CLASS-D group:&lt;/strong&gt; Yes, sir.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;TO:&lt;/strong&gt; Thank you. now, D-54224, can you please position your body camera so I can observe SCP-5232?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;D-54224:&lt;/strong&gt; Yes, sir.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;TO:&lt;/strong&gt; Which one of you entered the cell first?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;D-44463:&lt;/strong&gt; That would be me. Why do you ask?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;TO:&lt;/strong&gt; Please do not ask questions. Is that clear?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;D-44463:&lt;/strong&gt; Yes, sorry sir.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;D-54224:&lt;/strong&gt; Sir, the dice has stopped moving.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;TO:&lt;/strong&gt; Yes, I can see that,thank you. Its value is One. D-44463, do you feel anything strange or are you experiencing any pain?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;D-44463:&lt;/strong&gt; Nothing that I&#039;ve noticed so far.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;D-44463&lt;/strong&gt; Oh wait, I appear to have a scratch mark on my left shoulder. However, it&#039;s hardly bleeding.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;TO:&lt;/strong&gt; OK, thank you D-44463.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;D-74544:&lt;/strong&gt; Sir, the dice is rolling again. I&#039;m positioning the camera now so you can observe it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;TO:&lt;/strong&gt; I can not see the value. still, please can you tell me what it shows?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;D-93722:&lt;/strong&gt; It shows a four, Dr.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;TO:&lt;/strong&gt; Now, D-74544, you were second to enter the cell?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;D-74544:&lt;/strong&gt; Yes, correct, Sir&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;TO:&lt;/strong&gt; Please hand the camera over to D-93722.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;D-74544:&lt;/strong&gt; O&amp;#8230;Ok, why? What&#039;s going to happen to me?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;TO:&lt;/strong&gt; Please remain calm. D-74544, I do not know what will happen. That is why you&#039;re here.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;D-74544:&lt;/strong&gt; Ok? Am I going to at least&amp;#8230; make it out alive?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;TO:&lt;/strong&gt; Most likely, yes. No more questions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;D-74544:&lt;/strong&gt; I&#039;m starting to feel hot, like burning hot. Ow, I think I&#039;m starting to burn!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;TO:&lt;/strong&gt; Please stay calm, D-74544. And if you cannot then please do not scream.]&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;D-74544:&lt;/strong&gt; I can tr-&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;TO:&lt;/strong&gt; It appears from the camera that D-74544 has passed out from the pain, is that correct?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;D-93722:&lt;/strong&gt; Seems that way, Sir.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;TO:&lt;/strong&gt; Security? may you please come in and escort D-74544 to a medical team and D-44463 to receive Class-B Amnestics, thank you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Security Team:&lt;/strong&gt; Yes, sir.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;TO:&lt;/strong&gt; The two of you that entered last, please leave the cell and wait outside the door.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;D-54642:&lt;/strong&gt; That would be me and D-54224, sir. Should I leave the camera with D-93722?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;TO:&lt;/strong&gt; Yes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;D-93722:&lt;/strong&gt; Okay, so I just wait to see what my fate is, yes? And may I ask why they left the room?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;TO:&lt;/strong&gt; Did you not hear what I said to D-4463?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;D-93722:&lt;/strong&gt; Right, yes. Sorry.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;D-93722:&lt;/strong&gt; Its rolled a 1, same as D-44463.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;TO:&lt;/strong&gt; Interesting. D-93772, please check your left shoulder for a scratch mark.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;D-93772:&lt;/strong&gt; No scratch mark. However, I think my ankle is sprained.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;TO:&lt;/strong&gt; OK, so. It seems even though the dice can roll the same value, the effect will be different.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;TO:&lt;/strong&gt; Security? Can you please get D-54224 and D-54642 back in the cell?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SECURITY TEAM:&lt;/strong&gt;Done and done.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;TO:&lt;/strong&gt; The dice has stopped on a one, which one of you entered before the other?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;D-54224:&lt;/strong&gt; That would be me, Dr. I don&#039;t feel any pain or unease.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;TO:&lt;/strong&gt; Nothing at all?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;D-54224:&lt;/strong&gt; Nothing, sir.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;TO:&lt;/strong&gt; OK, thank you D-54224. Please leave the cell and Security will escort you to receive your post-experiment Amnestics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;D-54224:&lt;/strong&gt; Yes sir, thank you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;D-54642:&lt;/strong&gt; That leaves me now, Dr? The dice has started rolling again. It&#039;s stopped on a -wait.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;D-54642:&lt;/strong&gt; A Seven?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;On 12/7/20, The entire West wing of Site-33 was fully incinerated, with 14 injuries and 3 more alive out of 3,077 people. SCP-5232 is to be reclassified as Keter-Pending, as the dice has been found as the only thing intact.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Addendum SCP-5232-1&lt;/strong&gt; on 12/11/20, 53 more copies of SCP-5232 were found inside a Marshall,carter, and Dark equipment warehouse and stored inside advanced containment. Classification to Keter is approved.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;by &lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/researcher-pokefox&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6951479&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1607504783&quot; alt=&quot;Researcher PokeFox&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6951479)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/researcher-pokefox&quot;  &gt;Researcher PokeFox&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
